+  8-12   #distinct3 [function,total], one exhaustive pairwise-distinct rule
+  14-20  #allTriples [function,total], PString lengths 0/1/2 and recursive >=3
+  22-27  #happy [function,total], false for lengths 0/1/2 and #allTriples >=3
+  32-58  #solution [function], one nullary equation to the submitted Module term
+  No semantic cell rewrites, priorities, simplifications, opaque symbols, or
+  auxiliary reachability claims.
+
+spec.k / SPEC
